1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:19,861
Healthcare is becoming more data-driven, yet complex biomedical records can make early risk assessment difficult. Kushi Hygieia brings AI-assisted care, predictive tools, connected health records, hospital access, and a hybrid quantum machine-learning workflow into one platform.

2
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:34,303
Quantum Disease Intelligence explores how classical and quantum models can be tested against real biomedical data for disease-risk assessment.

3
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:56,222
The research workflow begins with a verified healthcare dataset. Preprocessing is kept separate from held-out evaluation. A classical baseline and a quantum model are configured, then compared on the same test samples.

4
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:10,333
This run uses Breast Cancer Wisconsin, with 569 samples and 30 features, from a documented open-source dataset.

5
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:26,632
The pipeline uses StandardScaler, median imputation, and principal component reduction. The page specifies that transformers are fit on training data only.

6
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:37,743
A support vector classifier provides the classical reference alongside a quantum support vector classifier.

7
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:54,843
The circuit uses a ZZFeatureMap, two repetitions, 1,024 simulation shots, and random seed 42.

8
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:14,518
I will not start a live training run on this deployment. Instead, its persistent experiment history lets us open a completed run.

9
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:40,487
This report records 114 holdout samples and 110.73 seconds of execution time for the selected cached experiment.

10
00:02:50,000 --> 00:03:03,532
In this run, the classical SVC reached 96.5 percent accuracy while the QSVC reached 60.5 percent. Performance is measured, not presumed.

11
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:23,988
The report lists four qubits, 17 gates, linear CNOT entanglement, and a circuit depth of 11.

12
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:44,008
It shows permutation feature importance, basis-state measurements, and metadata including seed 42 and the Qiskit Aer simulator.

13
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:11,372
Kushi Care AI is the conversational guidance interface. The general question submitted here returned an error, so no response is presented as successful.

14
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:30,908
The symptom checker presents an assessment form and clearly says it is not medical advice.

15
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:51,602
The Health Vault organizes records by category and provides controls to view, share, and manage them. This demonstration stays at the category level.

16
00:04:55,000 --> 00:05:01,934
The hospital directory lists partner facilities and indicates video-call or in-person availability.

17
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:21,927
Kushi Hygieia brings AI-assisted care, connected records, hospital services, and reproducible quantum machine learning together, with measurable results and clear limits.

